      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "infrastructure"
      },
      "description": "Five-minute packet rate, aligned beneath the matching pfSense WAN bit-rate panel. Packet counts and bits/s are different units, not interchangeable throughput measurements. Bridge-mode counter coverage is not yet verified. Failed or stale collection creates gaps.",
